     "question": "Tebgh-e ghaziye-ye meghdar-e miyani, agar f rooye [a, b] peyvaste bashad va adad-e C beyn-e f(a) va f(b) bashad, dast-kam yek c dar (a, b) hast ke f(c) barabar-e kodam ast?",
     "grading_key": "- [1] ⁦C⁩",
